{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-24","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：平面与平行四边形与平行线","englishTitle":"If a solid be contained by parallel planes, the opposite planes in it are equal and parallelogrammic.","book":11,"number":24,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.24","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.24/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":24,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-24@raw-d013e58131e496c2","contentId":"euclid-11-24","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d013e58131e496c2972ff7af118fc18851e2eae62c43b5c1b878bb3bf03f71cf","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-24.statement","euclid-11-24.construction.1","euclid-11-24.proof.1","euclid-11-24.proof.2","euclid-11-24.proof.3","euclid-11-24.proof.4","euclid-11-24.proof.5","euclid-11-24.proof.6","euclid-11-24.construction.2","euclid-11-24.proof.7","euclid-11-24.proof.8","euclid-11-24.proof.9","euclid-11-24.proof.10","euclid-11-24.conclusion","euclid-11-24.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-24.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-24","revisionId":"euclid-11-24@raw-d013e58131e496c2","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dd986403c59018e1d89003edbf9ee903a0dcbdd0a9e4c98b90103c0bc86cb94e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a solid be contained by parallel planes, the opposite planes in it are equal and parallelogrammic."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个固体由平行的平面形成, 与之相反的平面是相等的, 平行的图像。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-24.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-24","revisionId":"euclid-11-24@raw-d013e58131e496c2","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a7945591101f3659bea139321e6eed8320f76f5e7f9f812ff5a47cadf5a276e8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the solid CDHG be contained by the parallel planes AC, GF, AH, DF, BF, AE; I say that the opposite planes in it are equal and parallelogrammic."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"CDHG固体由平行平面、AC、GF、AH、DF、BF、AE形成;我说,与此相反的是,平面固体是平行的,是平行的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-24.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-24","revisionId":"euclid-11-24@raw-d013e58131e496c2","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6c6046e7fecf1ab555889a47536475c17dd14bf21c19e3a28741d228534d84e9","citations":["euclid-11-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since the two parallel planes BG, CE are cut by the plane AC, their common sections are parallel. [[XI. 16](/principles/euclid-11-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,由于两个平行的平面 BG,CE被平面 AC削减,它们的共同部分是平行的。 [[XI. 16](/principles/euclid-11-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-24.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-24","revisionId":"euclid-11-24@raw-d013e58131e496c2","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3e7603b51e9c891ab7fe2f8eea44c2611474f4a240f558304c552cd038690a7c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore AB is parallel to DC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB项与DC项平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-24.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-11-24","revisionId":"euclid-11-24@raw-d013e58131e496c2","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"079c7d2646f193132eb8d4c8f7972596a15afed18a74768ea631a025099c3122","citations":["euclid-11-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since the two parallel planes BF, AE are cut by the plane AC, their common sections are parallel. [[XI. 16](/principles/euclid-11-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于平行的平面 BF,AE被平面 AC截断,它们的共同部分是平行的。 [[XI. 16](/principles/euclid-11-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-24.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-11-24","revisionId":"euclid-11-24@raw-d013e58131e496c2","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3198d702c728e85b11119418fcb6db81f086713940dbf018d2c0308f4e5f0af2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore BC is parallel to AD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BC项与AD项平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-24.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-11-24","revisionId":"euclid-11-24@raw-d013e58131e496c2","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"05a5c2238c5d9e523d87314881a1ba383b5d7fa351ea7e6ef429c0d7d4464949","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AB was also proved parallel to DC; therefore AC is a parallelogram."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AB台也证明与DC台平行,因此AC台是平行四边形台。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-24.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-11-24","revisionId":"euclid-11-24@raw-d013e58131e496c2","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9275241f4955c069c5630cbdc13d3701e2223c18cfbdde938eebef4355f0f5ed","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that each of the planes DF, FG, GB, BF, AE is a parallelogram."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,平面 DF、FG、GB、BF、AE都是平行四边形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-24.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-11-24","revisionId":"euclid-11-24@raw-d013e58131e496c2","order":8,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1c51190dee6692ad1cca0ee5c3f92bdd23ccffa6d0feeca3f6d8ad1fdd42ce28","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AH, DF be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AH,DF连接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-24.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-11-24","revisionId":"euclid-11-24@raw-d013e58131e496c2","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f8f09c3ed4ef2e595f00ce91fadc5cabec5e8f2caa668a98479d909d12c96ece","citations":["euclid-11-10"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since AB is parallel to DC, and BH to CF, the two straight lines AB, BH which meet one another are parallel to the two straight lines DC, CF which meet one another, not in the same plane; therefore they will contain equal angles; [[XI. 10](/principles/euclid-11-10)] therefore the angle ABH is equal to the angle DCF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"之后,由于AB线与DC线和BH至CF线平行,相互交错的AB线和BH线与DC线和CF线平行,而这两条线不是在同一平面线上,因此它们包含相同角度;因此,ABH角等于DCF角。 [[XI. 10](/principles/euclid-11-10)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-24.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-11-24","revisionId":"euclid-11-24@raw-d013e58131e496c2","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0050df5843f55dbf053accf72f467c42159103b64c2fbf6e7f83704731b4b835","citations":["euclid-1-34","euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the two sides AB, BH are equal to the two sides DC, CF, [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)] and the angle ABH is equal to the angle DCF, therefore the base AH is equal to the base DF, and the triangle ABH is equal to the triangle DCF. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于双方AB,BH等于双方DC,CF,ABH角等于DCF角,因此底边,AH等于底边,DF,三角形ABH等于三角形DCF。 [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)] [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-24.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-11-24","revisionId":"euclid-11-24@raw-d013e58131e496c2","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"988c2d095c44b76ea94979fbb5ed124839e04506bb607a1563da431921777d71","citations":["euclid-1-34"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the parallelogram BG is double of the triangle ABH, and the parallelogram CE double of the triangle DCF; [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)] therefore the parallelogram BG is equal to the parallelogram CE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"平行四边形 BG是三角形ABH的两倍, 三角形DCF的平行四边形 CE是双倍。 因此,平行四边形 BG等于平行四边形 CE。 [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-24.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-11-24","revisionId":"euclid-11-24@raw-d013e58131e496c2","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"000118532e8fcef734155379fbc7d7bcaf585f526863f162708454fee51d7c31","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that AC is also equal to GF, and AE to BF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,AC也等于GF,AE等于BF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-24.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-11-24","revisionId":"euclid-11-24@raw-d013e58131e496c2","order":13,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-24.source","contentId":"euclid-11-24","revisionId":"euclid-11-24@raw-d013e58131e496c2","order":14,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3520785c8f476f6f6a6fe30ce0bce1b8b3d0d7d828fb1e6dd23f856989cad438","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.24/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.24\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-24:euclid-11-16:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-24","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-24.proof.1","euclid-11-24.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-16","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.24","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.24/","sourceLabel":"XI. 16"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-24:euclid-11-10:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-24","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-24.proof.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-10","type":"depends_on","prove